    "      20-35 A         1039    972     1.000   0.000      nan",
    "      35-60 A         4214   2423     1.000   0.000      nan",
    "    sphere R = 8 A     total |response| exact 2322.7 vs truncated 365.1 kcal/mol (15.7% of it)",
    "      shell          atoms   live   rel.err   slope  pearson",
